```sql
-- 8. Typo identified: EASTMART 
SELECT branch, COUNT(*) AS row_count
FROM ftw.default.transactions
WHERE branch LIKE '%EASTMART%'
GROUP BY branch
```

Result:

| branch                             | row_count |
| ---------------------------------- | --------: |
| EASTMART - MUNOZ                   |        15 |
| EASTMART - BETTER LIVING PARANAQUE |         6 |
| EASTMART - SOCORRO CUBAO           |         1 |


Correction:

```sql
UPDATE ftw.default.transactions
SET branch = REPLACE(branch, 'EASTMART', 'EASYMART')
WHERE branch LIKE '%EASTMART%'
```


Result:

| num_affected_rows |
|-------------------|
|22|
